149	     *         \  | &sum;y<sub>i</sub>y<sub>i</sub> &sum;x<sub>i</sub>z<sub>i</sub> - &sum;x<sub>i</sub>y<sub>i</sub> &sum;y<sub>i</sub>z<sub>i</sub>
