152	     *
153	     *
154	     *            |--------------------------
155	     *         \  | &sum;x<sub>i</sub>y<sub>i</sub> &sum;x<sub>i</sub>z<sub>i</sub> - &sum;x<sub>i</sub>x<sub>i</sub> &sum;y<sub>i</sub>z<sub>i</sub>
